ings.webp",[223,231,232],{},"The screenshot also includes admin-only settings (for example limiter, laws, filestore, and app config).",[234,235,12],"h2",{"id":236},"features",[238,239,240,244,247],"ul",{},[241,242,243],"li",{},"Configure job properties such as logo, radio frequency, and Discord bot sync.",[241,245,246],{},"Configure instance-level FiveNet options through the UI (server team).",[241,248,249,250],{},"For superusers:\n",[238,251,252,259,265,271],{},[241,253,254,258],{},[255,256,257],"strong",{},"Limiter",": Define which permissions each faction can assign to roles.",[241,260,261,264],{},[255,262,263],{},"Laws",": Configure law entries for each faction.",[241,266,267,270],{},[255,268,269],{},"Filestore",": Configure file storage per faction.",[241,272,273,276],{},[255,274,275],{},"App config",": Configure options that affect the entire FiveNet instance.",[234,278,280],{"id":279},"role-management","Role Management",[223,282,283],{},"Factions can manage their own roles when this is allowed by the permission system.",[223,285,286],{},[226,287],{"alt":288,"src":289},"features-settings-roles.webp","\u002Fimages\u002Fscreenshots\u002Ffeatures-settings-roles.webp",[234,291,293],{"id":292},"limiter-and-roles-explained","Limiter And Roles Explained",[223,295,296],{},"To allow role self-service safely, use the limiter to define the maximum permission set a faction can assign.\nFor example, you can allow the police faction to see colleague positions on the livemap, while preventing unauthorized factions from assigning that permission.\nIn practice, the limiter is a list of permissions and attributes available to roles within a faction.",[223,298,299],{},"Usually, the server management team defines these limits for each faction.",[234,301,303],{"id":302},"discord-bot-sync-roles-to-your-factions-discord","Discord Bot - Sync roles to your faction's Discord",[223,305,306],{},"Sync examples:",[238,308,309,312,315],{},[241,310,311],{},"Employee ranks",[241,313,314],{},"Absent\u002Fvacation status",[241,316,317,318,322],{},"Server-team groups on Discord servers connected to FiveNet (for example a ",[319,320,321],"code",{},"Project Leader"," role)",[223,324,325],{},[226,326],{"alt":327,"src":328},"Feature Settings - Job Props - Discord Bot","\u002Fimages\u002Fscreenshots\u002Ffeatures-discordbot.webp",[234,330,332],{"id":331},"app-config","App Config",[223,334,335],{},[226,336],{"alt":337,"src":338},"Feature Settings - App Config","\u002Fimages\u002Fscreenshots\u002Ffeatures-settings-appconfig.webp",[223,340,341],{},"App config contains options that affect the whole FiveNet instance, including:",[238,343,344,347,350,353,356,359],{},[241,345,346],{},"The default language for the app.",[241,348,349],{},"Default permissions.",[241,351,352],{},"Imprint and Privacy Policy links.",[241,354,355],{},"Livemap sync intervals.",[241,357,358],{},"Banner message with expiration time (for example to announce maintenance).",[241,360,361],{},"And more.",{"title":363,"searchDepth":364,"depth":364,"links":365},"",2,[366,367,368,369,370],{"id":236,"depth":364,"text":12},{"id":279,"depth":364,"text":280},{"id":292,"depth":364,"text":293},{"id":302,"depth":364,"text":303},{"id":331,"depth":364,"text":332},"Learn how to configure and manage settings in FiveNet, including job properties, roles, permissions, and app-wide configurations.","md",null,{},true,{"title":151,"description":371},"55vLMLgIY1GeHaFsgf81izPAfEv7G1PM8n8Tr8OtcYE",[379,380],{"title":147,"path":148,"stem":149,"description":363,"children":-1},{"title":155,"path":156,"stem":157,"description":381,"children":-1},"FiveNet supports multiple languages.",1788904830637]